                                <section class="unity-about-highlights__section unity-about-highlights__section--team"><div class="container"><div class="row"><h2>Team</h2><div class="unity-people-cards unity-people-cards--highlights unity-team--style-default"><div class="unity-people-cards__grid row"><div class="col-6 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 unity-card-container unity-people__card-wrap"><div class="card unity-card unity-people__card unity-people__card--pi"><a href="https://profiles.open.ac.uk/miriam-fernandez"><div class="row"><div class="unity-people__image"><img src="https://research.stem.open.ac.uk/ouanalyse/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/05/miriam-fernandez-150x150.jpg" alt="Miriam Fernandez" class="unity-people__img img-fluid"></div><div class="unity-people__body"><div class="unity-people__text"><i class="fa fa-arrow-right post-title-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3 class="unity-people__name">Miriam Fernandez</h3><p class="unity-people__title">Professor Of Responsible Artificial Intelligence</p><div class="unity-people__meta"><img src="https://schools.stem.open.ac.uk/cdn/img/icons/knowledge-media-institute-white.png" alt="knowledge-media-institute" class="unity-project-cards__icon"></div></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class="col-6 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 unity-card-container unity-people__card-wrap"><div class="card unity-card unity-people__card"><div class="row"><div class="unity-people__image"><img src="https://schools.stem.open.ac.uk/cdn/img/unity-default-profile.png" alt="Martin Hlosta" class="unity-people__img img-fluid is-fallback"></div><div class="unity-people__body"><div class="unity-people__text"><h3 class="unity-people__name">Martin Hlosta</h3><p class="unity-people__title">Research Fellow (Visiting Status)</p><div class="unity-people__meta"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-12 unity-view-more"><a href="https://research.stem.open.ac.uk/ouanalyse/team/" class="view-more-people unity-button-link">View all